            "review_text": "Dhiren56\nSingapore11 contributions\n0\nGreat dining experience at a lovely beach resort\nOct 2024 • Couples\nHad an excellent dining experience at Goji. Food is great but the service is exceptional. Kudos to Thao and Hoa who made the difference.\nWritten October 5, 2024\nDanang Marriott Resort & Spa\nDear Dhiren56,\nThank you so much for taking the time to share your wonderful experience at Goji! We are thrilled to hear that you enjoyed the food and had an exceptional dining experience. \nI will definitely pass on your kind words to Thao and Hoa, as they will be delighted to know that their efforts made a significant difference during your visit. Our team strives to provide outstanding service, and it’s always rewarding to receive positive feedback.\nWe look forward to welcoming you back to Goji for another fantastic meal soon!\nWarm regards,\nRead more\nWritten November 14, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
