            "review_text": "Companion39168796106\n1 contribution\n0\nNot a great experience\nMay 2024 • Family\nAfter waiting over 20 minutes for just anyone to attend to the table, I finally complained to the restaurant manager. Then another 20 minutes for the food, two of us finish before the other 2 meals arrived, cold and not edible. Now 20 more minutes to have the meals remade. We are Platinum Elite for life with Marriott and this isn’t typical.\nWritten May 14, 2024\nDanang Marriott Resort & Spa\nDear valued guest,\nThank you for taking the time to share your feedback regarding your recent experience at our restaurant. I sincerely apologize for the service delays and the issues you faced with your meals. This is not the standard we strive to uphold, and I completely understand your frustration.\nYour loyalty as a Platinum Elite member with Marriott is greatly appreciated, and it’s disheartening to hear that we did not meet your expectations during your visit. I assure you that your experience has been taken seriously, and we are addressing these concerns with our team to ensure that we provide the level of service that our guests deserve.\nPlease know that we value your feedback as it helps us improve. We hope to have the opportunity to welcome you back and provide you with the exceptional dining experience that you deserve.\nWarm regards,\nRead more\nWritten November 14, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
