            "review_title": "Review at Goji Kitchen + Bar",
            "review_text": "Sailesh S\n5 contributions\n0\nBrilliant service\nApr 2024 • Solo\nAll the staff (especially Nancy, Linh, Linh, Kathy) were absolutely brilliant during my first visit to Vietnam. They really went out of their way to address to my needs being a veggie.\nThey asked the chef to prepare veggie Vietnam breakfast which was absolutely delicious. I must admit I was a bit sceptical about having soup with noodles with garlic, onions and all the fresh herbs for breakfast especially since I am used to having oats with dried fruits and nuts with yogurt. \nAnd finally, I have to mention the room service and thank them for bringing fresh coconut, etc to my room every day.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 5, 2024\nDanang Marriott Resort & Spa\nDear Saileshs2024,\nThank you so much for sharing your wonderful experience during your recent visit to Vietnam! We are thrilled to hear that our staff, especially Nancy, Linh, Linh, and Kathy, made such a positive impression on you. \nIt’s fantastic to know that we could accommodate your dietary preferences and that you enjoyed the veggie Vietnamese breakfast prepared by our chef. We understand that trying new dishes can be a leap of faith, and we are glad you embraced the flavors and enjoyed it!\nWe're also pleased to hear that you appreciated our room service and the daily delivery of fresh coconut. Your kind words will be shared with our team, as they work hard to ensure every guest feels special and well cared for.\nThank you once again for your feedback. We hope to welcome you back and provide you with even more delightful experiences!\nBest regards,\nRead more\nWritten November 14, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
